Metroid Prime runtime library reconstruction attribution

The sources in src/prime/runtime, and the headers under include/prime, are
copied from the community decompilation of Metroid Prime:

  https://github.com/PrimeDecomp/prime
  commit 32020a07e571ccf6fa42329b4c09c4514daed449
  (extern/sdk/runtime, extern/sdk/libc, extern/sdk/include, and
  include/types.h, GameVersions.h, ByteOrder.hpp, static_assert.hpp)

That project is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0; its license text
is kept here as LICENSE.PrimeDecomp. Credit belongs to its contributors and to
the original Metrowerks and Nintendo authors. These are public reconstructions,
not an original source release. Preserve upstream notices and comments.

They are used where the Wind Waker reference (src/tww) lacks a file or links a
different revision. Local changes are listed in docs/Runtime.md.
